---
source: misc/tests/help.rs
expression: "help_output(\"rename\")"
---
Rename files by replacing occurrences of a string in their filenames

Usage: rename [options] <expression> <replacement> <file>...

Arguments:
  <EXPRESSION>   The expression to search for
  <REPLACEMENT>  The replacement string
  <FILES>...     Files to rename

Options:
  -s, --symlink       Act on the target of symlinks instead of the symlink itself
  -v, --verbose       Show which files were renamed
  -n, --no-act        Don't actually rename, just show what would happen
  -a, --all           Replace all occurrences of expression, not just the first
  -l, --last          Replace the last occurrence instead of the first
  -o, --no-overwrite  Don't overwrite existing files
  -i, --interactive   Ask before overwriting existing files
  -h, --help          Print help
